  "solution": "Solution**:**\n\n2 of 8 ÷ 3 + 3(4)/(5) ÷ x - 4(7)/(9) = 6(8)/(9)\n\n⇒ (16 / 3) + (19 / 5x) - (43 / 9) = 62 / 9\n\n⇒ 19 / 5x = (62 / 9) - (16 / 3) + (43 / 9) \n\n⇒ 19 / 5x = 57 / 9\n\n⇒ x = 3 / 5\n\n**Thus value of x is 3 / 5.**",
